    "name": "Forest Asylum 2",
    "steam_appid": 3727830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of the first game, the player enters therapy to process their trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arriving at the asylum, things don't go according to plan. A storm and the resulting power outage lead to events that will change their life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727830/extras/86429325df5745a95c5c2cc4984874a6.avif?t=1751876093\" data-has-big width=800 height=617 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the asylum in search of answers, collect items that will take you to other rooms of the asylum to find out what's really going on here, but beware, the danger is cunning and always after you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727830/extras/12559e28e9443d73cfe6ae68a396e555.avif?t=1751876093\" data-has-big width=800 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to escape the asylum alive? Or will you perish in a dark corner of the asylum's basement...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727830/extras/a1a6d9f965185cdda3092fd1479621ea.avif?t=1751876093\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cunning threat that reacts to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items and use them to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standalone story; playing the first game is not required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore and violence</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of the first game, the player enters therapy to process their trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arriving at the asylum, things don't go according to plan. A storm and the resulting power outage lead to events that will change their life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727830/extras/86429325df5745a95c5c2cc4984874a6.avif?t=1751876093\" data-has-big width=800 height=617 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the asylum in search of answers, collect items that will take you to other rooms of the asylum to find out what's really going on here, but beware, the danger is cunning and always after you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727830/extras/12559e28e9443d73cfe6ae68a396e555.avif?t=1751876093\" data-has-big width=800 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to escape the asylum alive? Or will you perish in a dark corner of the asylum's basement...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727830/extras/a1a6d9f965185cdda3092fd1479621ea.avif?t=1751876093\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cunning threat that reacts to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items and use them to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standalone story; playing the first game is not required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore and violence</p></li></ul>",
